:: ReturnEvent_Router {"position":"2800,650","size":"100,100"}
/% 귀환 이벤트는 보상 장면이다.
   스탯을 변화시키지 않는다.
   기록장에 남기지 않는다. %/
<<run setup.ensureTimeVariables && setup.ensureTimeVariables()>>
<<run setup.ensureEventCooldowns && setup.ensureEventCooldowns()>>
<<set $timeOfDay = "dawn">>
<<set $returnEventPending = false>>

<<if $debugMode>>
  <<if ($dayCount || $day || 1) < 2>>
    <<set _debugReturnEvent = random(1, 3)>>
    <<if _debugReturnEvent == 1>>
      <<goto "ReturnEvent_None">>
    <<elseif _debugReturnEvent == 2>>
      <<goto "ReturnEvent_Chicken">>
    <<else>>
      <<goto "ReturnEvent_SilentTemple">>
    <</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<set _debugReturnEvent = random(1, 6)>>
    <<if _debugReturnEvent == 1>>
      <<goto "ReturnEvent_WatchKuro">>
    <<elseif _debugReturnEvent == 2>>
      <<goto "ReturnEvent_ReedField">>
    <<elseif _debugReturnEvent == 3>>
      <<goto "ReturnEvent_Chicken">>
    <<elseif _debugReturnEvent == 4>>
      <<goto "ReturnEvent_HanbeiPretendSleep">>
    <<elseif _debugReturnEvent == 5 and ($dayCount || $day || 1) >= 3 and ($emmaEventUnlocked or $emmaIntroducedIsshin or $isshinUnlocked)>>
      <<goto "ReturnEvent_EmmaLamp">>
    <<else>>
      <<goto "ReturnEvent_SilentTemple">>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
<<set _r = random(1, 100)>>

<<if ($dayCount || $day || 1) >= 5 and ($shura || 0) >= 6 and _r <= 35 and setup.canRouteEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_SilentTemple")>>
  <<goto "ReturnEvent_SilentTemple">>
<<elseif ($dayCount || $day || 1) >= 3 and ($danger || 0) >= 5 and _r <= 45 and setup.canRouteEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_EmmaLamp")>>
  <<goto "ReturnEvent_EmmaLamp">>
<<elseif ($dayCount || $day || 1) >= 2 and ($kuroAffection || 0) >= 1 and _r <= 50 and setup.canRouteEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_WatchKuro")>>
  <<goto "ReturnEvent_WatchKuro">>
<<elseif ($dayCount || $day || 1) >= 2 and ($genichiroConflict || 0) >= 1 and _r <= 50 and setup.canRouteEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_ReedField")>>
  <<goto "ReturnEvent_ReedField">>
<<elseif ($dayCount || $day || 1) >= 2 and ($hanbeiAffection || 0) >= 1 and _r <= 50 and setup.canRouteEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_HanbeiPretendSleep")>>
  <<goto "ReturnEvent_HanbeiPretendSleep">>
<<elseif _r <= 20 and setup.canRouteEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_Chicken")>>
  <<goto "ReturnEvent_Chicken">>
<<else>>
  <<goto "ReturnEvent_None">>
<</if>>
<</if>>

:: ReturnEvent_None {"position":"2925,650","size":"100,100"}
<<run setup.markRoutedEvent && setup.markRoutedEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_None", 0)>>
<<goto "ReturnToTempleNextDay">>

:: ReturnEvent_WatchKuro {"position":"2925,750","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<run setup.markRoutedEvent && setup.markRoutedEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_WatchKuro", 1)>>
<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">황폐한 절로 돌아온 뒤에도,
늑대는 한동안 성 쪽을 바라보았다.

멀리,
작은 불빛이 남아 있었다.</div>
</div>

<<continueTo "ReturnEvent_WatchKuro_02">>
<</page>>

:: ReturnEvent_WatchKuro_02 {"position":"3050,750","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">
그곳에 주군이 있었다.

부르지 않는다.
다가가지도 않는다.

그저,
불이 꺼질 때까지 지켜보았다.</div>
</div>

<<continueTo "ReturnToTempleNextDay">>
<</page>>

:: ReturnEvent_ReedField {"position":"2925,850","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<run setup.markRoutedEvent && setup.markRoutedEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_ReedField", 1)>>
<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">황폐한 절로 돌아오는 길,
늑대는 성 쪽 갈대밭을 보았다.

바람이 불 때마다
익숙한 검집 소리가 섞여 들리는 듯했다.</div>
</div>

<<continueTo "ReturnEvent_ReedField_02">>
<</page>>

:: ReturnEvent_ReedField_02 {"position":"2950,850","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
